---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="초보개발자"
	description="Computer Science Student & Developer Resume"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<div class="resume-container">
		<!-- Contact Information -->
		<section class="resume-section">
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p><strong>Email:</strong> sunnyparkx87@gmail.com</p>
			<p><strong>Location:</strong> Busan, South Korea</p>
			<p><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/sunnypark87" target="_blank">github.com/sunnypark87</a></p>
		</section>

		<!-- Education -->
		<section class="resume-section">
			<h2>Education</h2>
			<p><strong>부산대학교 정보컴퓨터공학부</strong> (2020.3 - 현재)</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Skills -->
		<section class="resume-section">
			<h2>Skills</h2>
			<p><strong>Languages:</strong> JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, Java, C/C++</p>
			<p><strong>Web:</strong> HTML5, CSS3, React, Astro, Node.js</p>
			<p><strong>Tools:</strong> Git, VS Code, Figma, Linux</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Projects -->
		<section class="resume-section">
			<h2>Projects</h2>
			<p><strong>부산대학교 동아리 홍보 사이트</strong> - Next.js, MySQL, AWS</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Activities & Experience -->
		<section class="resume-section">
			<h2>Experience</h2>
			<p><strong>삼성 드림클래스</strong> (2024.03 ~ 2025.02) - 중학생 진로 멘토링</p>
			<p><strong>교환학생</strong> (2025.02 ~ 2025.06) - 스페인 부르고스 대학</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Languages -->
		<section class="resume-section">
			<h2>Languages</h2>
			<p>Korean (Native), English (Fluent), Spanish (Intermediate)</p>
		</section>
	</div>

	<style>
		.resume-container {
			max-width: 700px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 2rem;
			font-family: 'Atkinson Regular', sans-serif;
			line-height: 1.5;
		}

		.resume-section {
			margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			padding-bottom: 1rem;
			border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
		}

		.resume-section:last-child {
			border-bottom: none;
		}

		.resume-section h2 {
			color: #2c3e50;
			font-size: 1.3rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
			border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;
		}

		.resume-section p {
			margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
			color: #34495e;
		}

		.resume-section a {
			color: #3498db;
			text-decoration: none;
		}

		.resume-section a:hover {
			text-decoration: underline;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			.resume-container {
				padding: 1rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
